HB0195 Credit reporting-medical debt.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Provenza and Andrew and Senator(s)
Barlow and Hutchings
AN ACT relating to consumer protection; prohibiting the reporting of medical
debt to credit reporting agencies; creating a civil penalty; providing
definitions; making conforming amendments; specifying applicability; and
providing for an effective date.
